    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "skill_id": 51900,
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Hidden Dragon",
          "desc": "The Dragon Souls from his last 2 skill uses grant effects to his Basic Attacks, which <color=#fa863a>damages</color> one extra enemy.\n<color=#ffce49>He gains marks when using skills, enhancing his next Basic Attack.</color>\n<color=#4f6f95>When a target is attacked by more than 1 Dragon Soul, subsequent hits deal only 1% damage. When switching between Dragon Souls, souls of the same element are prioritized.</color>",
          "cd": 1000,
          "cost": 0,
          "tags": [
            "Enhance",
            "Damage"
          ],
          "icon": "https://camp.honorofkings.com/Global/Common/UGUI/SystemRes/902_HeroSkillIcon/51900.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 51910,
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Flaming Palm",
          "desc": "Unleashes sword energy, dealing <color=#fa863a>physical damage</color> and <color=#d9d9d9>true damage</color> to enemies within range.\nSubsequent Basic Attacks deal extra <color=#fa863a>damage</color>.",
          "cd": 12500,
          "cost": 60,
          "tags": [
            "Damage",
            "Damage"
          ],
          "icon": "https://camp.honorofkings.com/Global/Common/UGUI/SystemRes/902_HeroSkillIcon/51910.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 51920,
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Downpour",
          "desc": "Unleashes sword energy, dealing <color=#fa863a>physical damage</color> to enemies within range and recovering <color=#6fc075>Health</color> on hit.\nSubsequent Basic Attacks restore <color=#6fc075>Health</color> and <color=#6fc075>Mana</color>.",
          "cd": 12500,
          "cost": 60,
          "tags": [
            "Recover",
            "Damage"
          ],
          "icon": "https://camp.honorofkings.com/Global/Common/UGUI/SystemRes/902_HeroSkillIcon/51920.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 51940,
          "type": "Skill 3",
          "name": "Riding the Wind",
          "desc": "Unleashes sword energy, immediately gaining <color=#6fc075>Movement Speed</color> while <color=#fa863a>damaging</color> and <color=#50c1eb>knocking back</color> enemies within range.\nThe <color=#6fc075>Movement Speed</color> increase persists after the skill ends.",
          "cd": 12500,
          "cost": 60,
          "tags": [
            "Crowd Control",
            "Speed Up",
            "Damage"
          ],
          "icon": "https://camp.honorofkings.com/Global/Common/UGUI/SystemRes/902_HeroSkillIcon/51940.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 51930,
          "type": "Skill 4",
          "name": "Infinite Vastness",
          "desc": "Soars into the sky, then dives forward to <color=#fa863a>damage</color> and <color=#50c1eb>slow</color> enemies in his path. Landing deals equal <color=#fa863a>damage</color> and applies <color=#50c1eb>Dread</color>.\n<color=#ffce49>Enhances</color> himself, allowing his Basic Attacks to hit up to 2 more enemies.",
          "cd": 80000,
          "cost": 120,
          "tags": [
            "Enhance",
            "Crowd Control",
            "Damage"
          ],
          "icon": "https://camp.honorofkings.com/Global/Common/UGUI/SystemRes/902_HeroSkillIcon/51930.png"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "pros": [
          "Incredible late-game scaling",
          "Long attack range",
          "Great escape tool with Ultimate"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "Vulnerable to high mobility",
          "Needs items to impact the game",
          "Predictable damage output"
        ],
        "gameplay_tips": "## Early Game\nIn the early game, you want to prioritze farming and last-hitting minions, contesting around neutral objectives, and looking to use your range to poke enemies when they step up to last hit. Play around your cooldowns. If you have Skill 1 and either Skill 2/3 up, you can look to use these on the enemy hero and use Ao'Yin's long-range auto attack to deal a lot of poke damage.\n\n## Teamfights\nYour goal is to stay behind your frontline and watch out for enemy threats. Save your Ultimate Infinity Vastness for when you are about to die so you can reposition to safety. With Ao'Yin's long range, you can look to flash in with your Skills to finish off low-health enemies.\n\n## Tips & Tricks\nHaving 2 of the same soul will increase the effectiveness. For example, 2 Fire souls means your auto attacks will deal more damage\nIf you have mixed souls and want 2 of the same soul, tap the soul you want double of\nYou can change souls whilst in the air with your Ultimate"
      }
    },
